r cabinets stand outside the Northwest corner in the North road paver verge (N-02), and a streetlight pole stands along the North frontage between the NE and NW corners (N-03). The ground-floor Residential Care Room (g-care, 3.50 × 5.45 m = 19.08 m²) is positioned in the North/Northeast zone strictly east of the plot's East–West midpoint (X_geo in [7.65, 13.40] m >= 7.620 m), enjoying direct northward sightlines across the 12 m road to the colony garden at reclined (1.15 m), seated (1.20 m) and standing (1.63 m) eye heights, plus an oblique eastward glimpse to the court enclosure. A shaded L-shaped North Veranda with slender teak-collared columns, warm Jodhpuri sandstone paving and a woven-cane seating corner connects the living hall, care room and Northwest Caregiver Suite (3.20 × 2.50 m single bedroom + 2.05 × 1.40 m attached toilet), while preserving a landscaped Northwest open garden pocket and West boundary separation. Upstairs houses two family bedrooms with bathrooms, a compact office/studio, an upper store, east and north sandstone terraces, and continuous stair access to the roof terrace.","notices":["Custom Plan is authoritative: room geometry, floor assignments and openings bypass the automatic planner.","Eldercare request preserved. Specialist care-room and step-free access design require professional review; this generator does not certify them.","Setbacks are user-editable design assumptions, not verified municipal byelaws.","Cost rates are editable illustrative scenarios, not researched local quotations."],"orientation":"Road at local -Y; bearing is the outward road-facing true azimuth.","placement_hints":[],"planHash":"ecec1dcca986058d49251457904d8c3fc5ae4d4d728d34bfdf2c7aa781a0f0e5","provenance":{"attached_baths":{"selected":["quick-survey"],"superseded":["defaults"],"value":0},"bedrooms":{"selected":["quick-survey"],"superseded":["defaults"],"value":4},"budget_lakh":{"selected":["defaults"],"superseded":[],"value":65.0},"change_policy":{"selected":